{"parse": {"title": "Challenges", "pageid": 178, "revid": 44357, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 670px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/cd/Challenges.png/revision/latest?cb=20220707110003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Challenges are default Story Act with added difficulty, but also extra rewards. You must have the Story Act complete for the world to enter the Challenge.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"670\" height=\"399\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenges.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenges.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/cd/Challenges.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/670?cb=20220707110003\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/cd/Challenges.png/revision/latest?cb=20220707110003\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Challenges are default Story Act with added difficulty, but also extra rewards. You must have the Story Act complete for the world to enter the Challenge.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/cd/Challenges.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/670?cb=20220707110003\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"670\" height=\"399\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Challenges.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenges.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/cd/Challenges.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/670?cb=20220707110003\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Challenges.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><font size=\"4\"><b>Challenges</b> are default Story Act with added difficulty, but also extra rewards. You must have the Story Act complete for the world to enter the <b>Challenge</b>.</font></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Challenges change every 30 minutes\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"These_are_the_available_Challenges\">These are the available Challenges</span></h3>\n<ul><li><big><b>Tank Enemies</b></big> - Enemies have more Health and Armor</li>\n<li><big><b>High Cost</b></big> - Units cost 1.5x higher to upgrade and place</li>\n<li><big><b>Shield Enemies</b></big> - Enemies have 1 additional instance of shields.</li>\n<li><big><b>Regen Enemies</b></big> - Enemies Regenerate health over time (except Flying enemies)</li>\n<li><big><b>Short Range</b></big> - All Units have a 2/3 shorter range</li>\n<li><big><b>Fast Enemies</b></big> - Enemies move faster</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"These_are_the_Challenges_that_are_only_available_at_Demon_Academy_Portal\">These are the Challenges that are only available at Demon Academy Portal</span></h3>\n<ul><li><big><b>Hyper-Regen Enemies</b></big> - Enemies Regenerate even more health over time (except Flying enemies)</li>\n<li><big><b>Flying Enemies</b></big> - All enemies are Flying (enemies that can regen still can regen)</li>\n<li><big><b>Steel-Plated Enemies</b></big> - Enemies have thrice the health, and have 20 additional instances of shields.</li>\n<li><big><b>Godspeed Enemies</b></big> - Enemies move even faster.</li>\n<li><big><b>Mini Range</b></big> - All Units have a 1/4 shorter range. Note that units' AoE aren't affected, making the likes of <a href=\"/wiki/Hybrid_Units\" title=\"Hybrid Units\">Hybrid Units</a> or any unit with extreme AoE viable.</li>\n<li><big><b>Triple Cost</b></big> - Units cost 3x higher to upgrade and place.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Regular_challenges\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Regular challenges</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Daily_Challenge\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Daily Challenge</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Regular_challenges\">Regular challenges</span></h2>\n<p>Beating any of these Challenges can grant you the following rewards: \n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\" style=\"border: 1px solid #302D40; border-radius:2em; overflow:hidden; display:block; width:400px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 15px #a3f7e8; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><center><font size=\"4\"><b>Reward</b></font></center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:220px;\"><b>Star Fruit (Random)</b>\n<ul><li>Chance at up to 7 of any of the star fruits.</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><center><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Star Fruit (Rainbow)\"><img alt=\"Star Fruit (Rainbow)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/b2/Star_Fruit_%28Rainbow%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20250104181043\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Star Fruit (Rainbow).png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Fruit_%28Rainbow%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Star Fruit (Red)\"><img alt=\"Star Fruit (Red)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e2/Star_Fruit_%28Red%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20230101142331\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Star Fruit (Red).png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Fruit_%28Red%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Star Fruit (Green)\"><img alt=\"Star Fruit (Green)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/a8/Star_Fruit_%28Green%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20221227193321\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Star Fruit (Green).png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Fruit_%28Green%29.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Star Fruit (Pink)\"><img alt=\"Star Fruit (Pink)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Star Fruit (Pink).png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Fruit_%28Pink%29.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/45/Star_Fruit_%28Pink%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20250102183526\" /></a></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Star Fruit (Blue)\"><img alt=\"Star Fruit (Blue)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Star Fruit (Blue).png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Fruit_%28Blue%29.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/5/53/Star_Fruit_%28Blue%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20221227193339\" /></a></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Star Fruit\"><img alt=\"Star Fruit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Star Fruit.png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Fruit.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/c/c4/Star_Fruit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20220825022342\" /></a></span></b></center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1 Rainbow Star Fruit </b>\n</td>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Star Fruit (Rainbow)\"><img alt=\"Star Fruit (Rainbow)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Star Fruit (Rainbow).png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Fruit_%28Rainbow%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/b2/Star_Fruit_%28Rainbow%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20250104181043\" /></a></span></center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Extra Gems</b>\n</td>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">100 Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">100 Gems</span></span></a></center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Extra Gold </b>\n</td>\n<td><center><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\">200 Gold</span></a></center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Star Remnant </b>\n</td>\n<td><center><b>1 or 2<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Star Remnant\"><img alt=\"Star Remnant\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Star Remnant.png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Remnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fd/Star_Remnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20250102035557\" /></a></span></b></center>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Daily_Challenge\">Daily Challenge</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Beating_Daily_Challenge_can_grants_you_10_to_50_Star_Remnants.2C_2_to_3_Stat_Cubes.2C_and_a_chance_for_1_Perfect_Stat_Cube.\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Beating_Daily_Challenge_can_grants_you_10_to_50_Star_Remnants,_2_to_3_Stat_Cubes,_and_a_chance_for_1_Perfect_Stat_Cube.\">Beating Daily Challenge can grants you 10 to 50 <b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Star Remnant\"><img alt=\"Star Remnant\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Star Remnant.png\" data-image-key=\"Star_Remnant.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/f/fd/Star_Remnant.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20250102035557\" /></a></span>Star Remnants, 2 to 3 <span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"dottedText\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Stat Cube\"><img alt=\"Stat Cube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stat Cube.png\" data-image-key=\"Stat_Cube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/46/Stat_Cube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230228230815\" /></span></span> Stat Cube</span><br /></span>s, and a chance for 1 <span style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"dottedText\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Perfect Stat Cube\"><img alt=\"Perfect Stat Cube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Perfect Stat Cube.png\" data-image-key=\"Perfect_Stat_Cube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/83/Perfect_Stat_Cube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230228230832\" /></span></span> Perfect Stat Cube</span><br /></span>.</b></span></h3>\n<p>Enemies can have <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Affinities_/_Elements\" title=\"Damage Affinities / Elements\">resistance or weakness</a> for the following types:\n</p>\n<ul><li>The main type of damage will always appear in challenges, and the secondary with some chance</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center><font size=\"5\"><b>Damage Type</b></font></center>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 10px 20px; border: 10px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border-radius: 10px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border-radius: 5px;padding: 1px 10px; height: 45px; background: #0C0C0C; border-color: #EC0105; border-width: 2px; background: rgb(0,0,0, 0.5);\"><font color=\"#FFABAB\" size=\"5\" style=\"text-shadow: 1px 0 1px #F00104, 0 1px 1px #F00104, -1px 0 1px #F00104, 0 -1px 1px #F00104;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212653\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Physical\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Physical.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Physical.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/8/81/Damage_type_Physical.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20221113212653\" /></a></span>  Physical</font>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-radius: 5px;padding: 1px 10px; height: 45px; background: #0C0C0C; border-color: #0638C3; border-width: 2px; background: rgb(0,0,0, 0.5);\"><font color=\"#38FCFF\" size=\"5\" style=\"text-shadow: 1px 0 1px #104BFC, 0 1px 1px #104BFC, -1px 0 1px #104BFC, 0 -1px 1px #104BFC;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Magic\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Magic.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Magic.png\" data-releva